    And the display type is Digital          # features/steps/clock_steps.py:88
    When I tap the clock display             # features/steps/clock_steps.py:102
    Then the display type is Analogue        # features/steps/clock_steps.py:98
    When I tap the clock display             # features/steps/clock_steps.py:102
    Then the display type is Nixie           # features/steps/clock_steps.py:98
    When I tap the clock display             # features/steps/clock_steps.py:102
    Then the display type is Digital         # features/steps/clock_steps.py:98

  @clock @display @wip
  Scenario: Display type persists across restart (future)  # features/app/clock_app.feature:101
    Given the display type is Nixie                        # features/steps/clock_steps.py:88
    And the app is restarted                               # features/steps/clock_steps.py:180
    Then the display type is Nixie                         # features/steps/clock_steps.py:98

